  "content": "<p>老家广东河源的山里，自己种的茶树。今年茶桃结得不多，摘了三天，摊在院子里晒，月底拉去镇上油坊物理压榨。</p>\n<p>大概百来斤油，卖完就没了。75 一斤，5 斤装 375，10 斤装 750，发顺丰，广东包邮，外省看具体地址补邮费。</p>\n<p>先说清楚：不是精炼油，没有检测报告，籽是晒干后手工挑过的。颜色偏深、底部有点沉淀，正常现象。</p>\n<p>月底开榨，榨完沉淀几天再装壶发货。收到不满意、未开封 7 天可退。</p>\n<p>微信：TDc0MTEyMjM=，站内私信也行。</p>\n<p>补几张现拍的晾晒图片</p>\n<p><img alt=\"1.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/11/17/NmwtGg9A.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/11/17/xF2opfjq.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"3.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/11/17/XENKms6G.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"4.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/11/17/3I4URv3N.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"5.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/11/17/g5MyRY7Y.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"6.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/11/17/Q9GQ61zq.jpg\"/></p>",
